{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #57", "duration_min": 15.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Find the value of (5<sup>1</sup>  -  5<sup>2/3</sup> + 5<sup>5/3</sup>) (5<sup>1/3</sup>  -  5<sup>4/3</sup>) + 4 * 5<sup>4/3.</sup></p>", "q_hi": "<p>(5<sup>1</sup> - 5<sup>2/3</sup> + 5<sup>5/3</sup>) (5<sup>1/3</sup> - 5<sup>4/3</sup>) + 4 * 5<sup>4/3.</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["120", "-120", "80", "-80"], "options_hi": ["120", "-120", "80", "-80"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>(5<sup>1</sup>  -  5<sup>2/3</sup> + 5<sup>5/3</sup>) (5<sup>1/3</sup>  -  5<sup>4/3</sup>) + 4 * 5<sup>4/3</sup></p><p>= (5<sup>4/3</sup>  -  5 + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>7/3</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup>) + 4 * 5<sup>4/3</sup></p><p>= (5<sup>4/3</sup>  -  5 + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>7/3</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup>) + 5<sup>4/3</sup> (5<sup>1</sup>  -  1)</p><p>= (5<sup>4/3</sup>  -  5 + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>7/3</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup>) + 5<sup>7/3</sup>  -  5<sup>4/3</sup></p><p>=  - 5 + 5<sup>2</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup></p><p>=  - 5 + 25 + 25  -  125</p><p>=  - 80</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(5<sup>1</sup>  -  5<sup>2/3</sup> + 5<sup>5/3</sup>) (5<sup>1/3</sup>  -  5<sup>4/3</sup>) + 4 * 5<sup>4/3</sup></p><p>= (5<sup>4/3</sup>  -  5 + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>7/3</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup>) + 4 * 5<sup>4/3</sup></p><p>= (5<sup>4/3</sup>  -  5 + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>7/3</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup>) + 5<sup>4/3</sup> (5<sup>1</sup>  -  1)</p><p>= (5<sup>4/3</sup>  -  5 + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>7/3</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup>) + 5<sup>7/3</sup>  -  5<sup>4/3</sup></p><p>=  - 5 + 5<sup>2</sup> + 5<sup>2</sup>  -  5<sup>3</sup></p><p>=  - 5 + 25 + 25  -  125</p><p>=  - 80</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following given values is not greater than 20<sup>1/3</sup></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; 20<sup>1/3</sup></p> &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2343;&#2367;&#2325; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;", "options_en": ["(8)<sup>1/2</sup>", "(180000)<sup>1/12</sup>", "(398)<sup>1/6</sup>", "(56)<sup>1/4</sup>"], "options_hi": ["(8)<sup>1/2</sup>", "(180000)<sup>1/12</sup>", "(398)<sup>1/6</sup>", "(56)<sup>1/4</sup>"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Comparing 20<sup>1/3</sup> and 8<sup>1/2</sup> :</p><p>LCM of 3 and 2 = 6</p><p>(20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>6</sup> and (8<sup>1/2</sup>)<sup>6</sup></p><p>20<sup>2</sup> = 400 and 8<sup>3</sup> = 512</p><p>As, 8<sup>3</sup> is greater than 20<sup>2</sup>, 8<sup>1/2</sup> is greater than 20<sup>1/3</sup></p><p>Similarly,</p><p>((180000)<sup>1/12</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 180000</p><p>(20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 160000</p><p>Hence, (18000)<sup>1/12</sup> is greater than 20<sup>1/3</sup></p><p>(398)<sup>1/6</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 398 is smaller than (20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 400</p><p>(398)<sup>1/6</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 398 is smaller than (20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 400</p><p>(56<sup>1/4</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 175616 is greater than (20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 160000</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Comparing 20<sup>1/3</sup> and 8<sup>1/2</sup> :</p><p>LCM of 3 and 2 = 6</p><p>(20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>6</sup> and (8<sup>1/2</sup>)<sup>6</sup></p><p>20<sup>2</sup> = 400 and 8<sup>3</sup> = 512</p><p>As, 8<sup>3</sup> is greater than 20<sup>2</sup>, 8<sup>1/2</sup> is greater than 20<sup>1/3</sup></p><p>Similarly,</p><p>((180000)<sup>1/12</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 180000</p><p>(20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 160000</p><p>Hence, (18000)<sup>1/12</sup> is greater than 20<sup>1/3</sup></p><p>(398)<sup>1/6</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 398 is smaller than (20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 400</p><p>(398)<sup>1/6</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 398 is smaller than (20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>6</sup> = 400</p><p>(56<sup>1/4</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 175616 is greater than (20<sup>1/3</sup>)<sup>12</sup> = 160000</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If 2<sup>2a</sup> = 8<sup>b</sup> and ab = 24, then find the value of a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>, where a and b are positive numbers.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2<sup>2a</sup> = 8<sup>b</sup> &#2324;&#2352; ab = 24, &#2340;&#2379; a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; a &#2324;&#2352; b &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["280", "368", "133", "539"], "options_hi": ["280", "368", "133", "539"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>2<sup>2a</sup> = 8<sup>b</sup> = 2<sup>3b</sup></p><p>2a = 3b =&gt; a = 3b/2</p><p>and ab = 24</p><p>b*3b/2 = 24</p><p>b = 4</p><p>a = 3*4/2 = 6</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> = 6<sup>3</sup> + 4<sup>3</sup> = 216 + 64 = 280</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>2<sup>2a</sup> = 8<sup>b</sup> = 2<sup>3b</sup></p><p>2a = 3b =&gt; a = 3b/2</p><p>and ab = 24</p><p>b*3b/2 = 24</p><p>b = 4</p><p>a = 3*4/2 = 6</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> = 6<sup>3</sup> + 4<sup>3</sup> = 216 + 64 = 280</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If 5 <sup>(a + b) </sup>= 125 and 25 <sup>(a  -  b) </sup>= 625, find the value of 2a.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 5 <sup>(a + b) </sup>= 125 &#2324;&#2352; 25 <sup>(a - b) </sup>= 625, &#2340;&#2379; 2a &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["10", "5", "8", "1"], "options_hi": ["10", "5", "8", "1"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=97 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25700/image001.png\"></p><p><img width=117 height=23 src=\"ht