<img width=115 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25700/image048.png\"></p><p><img width=112 height=56 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25700/image049.png\"></p><p><img width=124 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25700/image050.png\"></p><p><img width=77 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25700/image051.png\"></p><p><img width=24 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25700/image052.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If (a/b)<sup>x-1</sup>= (b/a)<sup>x-7</sup>, then what is the value of x ? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (a/b)<sup>x-1</sup>= (b/a)<sup>x-7</sup> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["4", "3", "2", "1"], "options_hi": ["4", "3", "2", "1"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>(a/b)<sup>x-1 </sup>= (b/a)<sup>x-7</sup></p> <p>(a/b)<sup>x-1</sup> = (a/b)<sup>-(x-7)</sup></p> <p>x-1= -(x-7)</p> <p>x-1= -x+7</p> <p>2x=8 &#8594;x=8/2=4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(a/b)<sup>x-1 </sup>= (b/a)<sup>x-7</sup></p> <p>(a/b)<sup>x-1</sup> = (a/b)<sup>-(x-7)</sup></p> <p>x-1= -(x-7)</p> <p>x-1= -x+7</p> <p>2x=8 &#8594;x=8/2=4</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of [(1024)<sup>x/5</sup>  X  (4)<sup>4x-1</sup>]/[64<sup>x</sup>  X  (16)<sup>x-1</sup>]?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>[(1024)<sup>x/5</sup> X (4)<sup>4x-1</sup>]/[64<sup>x</sup> X (16)<sup>x-1</sup>] &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["4", "16", "1/4", "1/16"], "options_hi": ["4", "16", "1/4", "1/16"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>(1024)<sup>x/5</sup> = (4<sup>5</sup>)<sup>x/5</sup></p><p>64<sup>x</sup> = 4<sup>3x</sup>, 16<sup>x-1</sup> = (4<sup>2</sup>)<sup>x-1</sup></p><p>Put these values in equation,</p><p>= [(4<sup>5</sup>)<sup>x/5</sup>  X  (4)<sup>4x-1</sup>]/[ 4<sup>3x</sup>  X  (4<sup>2</sup>)<sup>x-1</sup></p><p>= 4<sup>x + 4x  -  1 </sup>/ 4<sup>3x + 2x  -  2</sup></p><p>= 4<sup>5x -1</sup> / 4<sup>5x -2</sup></p><p>= 4<sup>5x -1 -5x +2</sup> = 4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(1024)<sup>x/5</sup> = (4<sup>5</sup>)<sup>x/5</sup></p><p>64<sup>x</sup> = 4<sup>3x</sup>, 16<sup>x-1</sup> = (4<sup>2</sup>)<sup>x-1</sup></p><p>Put these values in equation,</p><p>= [(4<sup>5</sup>)<sup>x/5</sup>  X  (4)<sup>4x-1</sup>]/[ 4<sup>3x</sup>  X  (4<sup>2</sup>)<sup>x-1</sup></p><p>= 4<sup>x + 4x  -  1 </sup>/ 4<sup>3x + 2x  -  2</sup></p><p>= 4<sup>5x -1</sup> / 4<sup>5x -2</sup></p><p>= 4<sup>5x -1 -5x +2</sup> = 4</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the value of [(243<sup>n/5</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>)/(9<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>n  -  1</sup>)]?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>[(243<sup>n/5</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>)/(9<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>n - 1</sup>)] &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["9", "12", "6", "15"], "options_hi": ["9", "12", "6", "15"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>= [(243<sup>n/5</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>)/(9<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>n  -  1</sup>)]</p><p>= [{(3<sup>5</sup>)<sup>n/5</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>}/{(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>n  -  1</sup>}]</p><p>= [(3<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>)/(3<sup>2n</sup> * 3<sup>n  -  1</sup>)]</p><p>= (3<sup>(n + 2n + 1)</sup>)/(3<sup>(2n + n  -  1)</sup>)</p><p>= 3<sup>(3n + 1)</sup>)/(3<sup>(3n  -  1)</sup>)</p><p>= 3<sup>(3n + 1  -  3n + 1)</sup></p><p>= 3<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>= [(243<sup>n/5</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>)/(9<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>n  -  1</sup>)]</p><p>= [{(3<sup>5</sup>)<sup>n/5</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>}/{(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>n  -  1</sup>}]</p><p>= [(3<sup>n</sup> * 3<sup>2n + 1</sup>)/(3<sup>2n</sup> * 3<sup>n  -  1</sup>)]</p><p>= (3<sup>(n + 2n + 1)</sup>)/(3<sup>(2n + n  -  1)</sup>)</p><p>= 3<sup>(3n + 1)</sup>)/(3<sup>(3n  -  1)</sup>)</p><p>= 3<sup>(3n + 1  -  3n + 1)</sup></p><p>= 3<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 9</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Solve (X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>/X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>) * (X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>/X<sup>-5</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-4</sup>Y<sup>-1</sup>/X<sup>2</sup> Y<sup>2</sup>) = ?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>(X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>/X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>) * (X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>/X<sup>-5</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-4</sup>Y<sup>-1</sup>/X<sup>2</sup> Y<sup>2</sup>) = ?, &#2361;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; ?</p>", "options_en": ["X<sup>13</sup> Y<sup>-4</sup>", "X<sup>13</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>", "X<sup>-13</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>", "X<sup>13</sup> Y<sup>4</sup>"], "options_hi": ["X<sup>13</sup> Y<sup>-4</sup>", "X<sup>13</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>", "X<sup>-13</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>", "X<sup>13</sup> Y<sup>4</sup>"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>(X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>/X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>)  * (X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>/X<sup>-5</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-4</sup>Y<sup>-1</sup>/X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup>) = (X<sup>-1</sup>Y<sup>-7</sup>) )  * (X<sup>8</sup>Y<sup>0</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-6</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>)</p><p>= (X<sup>7</sup>Y<sup>-7</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-6</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>) = X<sup>13</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup>/X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>3</sup>)  * (X<sup>3</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>/X<sup>-5</sup>Y<sup>-2</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-4</sup>Y<sup>-1</sup>/X<sup>2</sup>Y<sup>2</sup>) = (X<sup>-1</sup>Y<sup>-7</sup>) )  * (X<sup>8</sup>Y<sup>0</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-6</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>)</p><p>= (X<sup>7</sup>Y<sup>-7</sup>) &div; (X<sup>-6</sup>Y<sup>-3</sup>) = X<sup>13</sup>Y<sup>-4</sup></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>1/ (1 + a<sup>n-m</sup>) + 1/ (1 + a<sup>m-n</sup>) =?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>1/ (1 + a<sup>n-m</sup>) + 1/ (1 + a<sup>m-n</sup>) =?</p>", "options_en": ["0", "&frac12;", "1", "a<sup>m+n</sup>"], "options_hi": ["0", "&frac12;", "1", "a<sup>m+n</sup>"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>1/ (1 + a<sup>n-m</sup>) + 1/ (1 + a<sup>m-n</sup>)</p><p>= 1/ (1 + a<sup>n</sup>/a<sup>m</sup>) + 1/ (1 + a<sup>m</sup>/a<sup>n</sup>)</p><p>= a<sup>m</sup>/ (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>) + a<sup>n</sup>/ (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>)</p><p>= (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>)/ (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>)</p><p>= 1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>1/ (1 + a<sup>n-m</sup>) + 1/ (1 + a<sup>m-n</sup>)</p><p>= 1/ (1 + a<sup>n</sup>/a<sup>m</sup>) + 1/ (1 + a<sup>m</sup>/a<sup>n</sup>)</p><p>= a<sup>m</sup>/ (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>) + a<sup>n</sup>/ (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>)</p><p>= (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>)/ (a<sup>m</sup> + a<sup>n</sup>)</p><p>= 1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find x if:</p><p><img width=151 height=87 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image165.gif\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;</p><p><img width=\"151\" height=\"87\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image165.gif\"> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["2", "1", "0", "-1"], "options_hi": ["2", "1", "0", "-1"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Given,</p><p><img width=156 height=87 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image166.gif\"></p><p><img width=153 height=97 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image167.gif\"></p><p><img width=191 height=71 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image168.gif\"></p><p><img width=55 height=24 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image169.gif\"></p><p>Hence the value of x is 1.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given,</p><p><img width=156 height=87 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image166.gif\"></p><p><img width=153 height=97 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image167.gif\"></p><p><img width=191 height=71 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image168.gif\"></p><p><img width=55 height=24 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p13744/image169.gif\"></p><p>Hence the value of x is 1.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If 5<sup>3a + 2b </sup>= 625 and 7<sup>2a + b </sup>= 49, then find the value of 'b'.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 5<sup>3a + 2b </sup>= 625 &#2324;&#2352; 7<sup>2a + b </sup>= 49 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 'b' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;?</p>", "options_en": ["1", "2", "3", "4"], "options_hi": ["1", "2", "3", "4"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Here, 5<sup>3a + 2b </sup>= 625</p><p>5<sup>3a + 2b </sup>= 5<sup>4</sup></p><p>3a + 2b = 4 =&gt; a = (4  -  2b)/3 ...(i)</p><p>And 7<sup>2a + b </sup>= 49</p><p>7<sup>2a + b </sup>= 7<sup>2</sup></p><p>2a + b = 2 =&gt; a = (2  -  b)/2 ...(ii)</p><p>From (i) and (ii)), we have</p><p>(4  -  2b)/3 = (2  -  b)/2</p><p>2(4  -  2b) = 3(2  -  b)</p><p>8  -  4b = 6  -  3b</p><p><b>b = 2</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, 5<sup>3a + 2b </sup>= 625</p><p>5<sup>3a + 2b </sup>= 5<sup>4</sup></p><p>3a + 2b = 4 =&gt; a = (4  -  2b)/3 ...(i)</p><p>And 7<sup>2a + b </sup>= 49</p><p>7<sup>2a + b </sup>= 7<sup>2</sup></p><p>2a + b = 2 =&gt; a = (2  -  b)/2 ...(ii)</p><p>From (i) and (ii)), we have</p><p>(4  -  2b)/3 = (2  -  b)/2</p><p>2(4  -  2b) = 3(2  -  b)</p><p>8  -  4b = 6  -  3b</p><p><b>b = 2</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The value of the folllowing expression is &nbsp;</p><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">625<sup>n/4</sup> * 25<sup>3n-2</sup>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">625<sup>n/4</sup> * 25<sup>3n-2</sup>", "options_en": ["3125", "1/125", "1/625", "1/3125"], "options_hi": ["3125", "1/125", "1/625", "1/3125"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>[625<sup>n/4</sup> * 25<sup>3n - 2</sup>]/[125<sup>n</sup> * 5<sup>4n + 1</sup>]</p><p>= [5<sup>4 * n/4</sup> * 5<sup>6n - 4</sup>]/[5<sup>3n</sup> * 5<sup>4n + 1</sup>]</p><p>= [5<sup>n + 6n - 4 </sup>]/[5<sup>7n + 1</sup>]</p><p>= 5<sup>7n - 4 - 7n - 1</sup></p><p>= 5<sup>-5</sup></p><p>= 1/3125</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[625<sup>n/4</sup> * 25<sup>3n - 2</sup>]/[125<sup>n</sup> * 5<sup>4n + 1</sup>]</p><p>= [5<sup>4 * n/4</sup> * 5<sup>6n - 4</sup>]/[5<sup>3n</sup> * 5<sup>4n + 1</sup>]</p><p>= [5<sup>n + 6n - 4 </sup>]/[5<sup>7n + 1</sup>]</p><p>= 5<sup>7n - 4 - 7n - 1</sup></p><p>= 5<sup>-5</sup></p><p>= 1/3125</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify the given equation.</p><p>(27<sup>2/3</sup> &div; 8<sup>4/3</sup>) * (32<sup>4/5 </sup>&div; 81<sup>1/4</sup>)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p>(27<sup>2/3</sup> &div; 8<sup>4/3</sup>) * (32<sup>4/5 </sup>&div; 81<sup>1/4</sup>)</p>", "options_en": ["3", "6", "4", "9"], "options_hi": ["3", "6", "4", "9"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>= (27<sup>2/3</sup> &div; 8<sup>4/3</sup>) * (32<sup>4/5 </sup>&div; 81<sup>1/4</sup>)</p><p>= (3<sup>2</sup> &div; 2<sup>4</sup>) * (2<sup>4 </sup>&div; 3)</p><p>= (3<sup>2-1</sup> &div; 2<sup>4-4</sup>)</p><p>= <b>3</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>= (27<sup>2/3</sup> &div; 8<sup>4/3</sup>) * (32<sup>4/5 </sup>&div; 81<sup>1/4</sup>)</p><p>= (3<sup>2</sup> &div; 2<sup>4</sup>) * (2<sup>4 </sup>&div; 3)</p><p>= (3<sup>2-1</sup> &div; 2<sup>4-4</sup>)</p><p>= <b>3<